"<qt>\n"
"Enable shortcuts that allow you to quickly search for information on the "
"web. For example, entering the shortcut <b>gg:KDE</b> will result in a "
"search for the word <b>KDE</b> on the Google(TM) search engine.\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>\n"
"Mit Söökafkörten kannst Du gau in't Nett na Informatschonen söken. Wenn Du a."
"B. <b>gg:KDE</b> ingiffst, warrt mit de Söökmaschien \"Google (TM)\" na't "
"Woort <b>KDE</b> söcht.\n"
"</qt>"

